      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 4.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.26,
      "end_seconds": 10.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.04,
      "end_seconds": 14.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I've been misplacing things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.48,
      "end_seconds": 17.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.29,
      "end_seconds": 26.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Ah I'm on something called losa... losartan 50 milligrams maybe once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.92,
      "end_seconds": 30.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.68,
      "end_seconds": 42.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.64,
      "end_seconds": 45.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.72,
      "end_seconds": 53.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "for about a year I'd say i've also been repeating the same question"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.23,
      "end_seconds": 59.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "so, what about a low mood, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.16,
      "end_seconds": 67.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "yes about the same three weeks. As for low mood mild I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.31,
      "end_seconds": 87.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "nothing like bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.77,
      "end_seconds": 90.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No. No bladder problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.69,
      "end_seconds": 98.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "alright, a a few quick ones: headache, hallucinations, falls or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.99,
      "end_seconds": 103.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.13,
      "end_seconds": 106.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "okay, is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.52,
      "end_seconds": 109.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.46,
      "end_seconds": 112.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Any surgery in the the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.81,
      "end_seconds": 124.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "yes, I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder, two years back i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.49,
      "end_seconds": 131.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.2,
      "end_seconds": 135.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.46,
      "end_seconds": 141.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.93,
      "end_seconds": 144.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Yes high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.68,
      "end_seconds": 146.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.56,
      "end_seconds": 149.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.28,
      "end_seconds": 156.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.63,
      "end_seconds": 171.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.37,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.08,
      "end_seconds": 175.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.18,
      "end_seconds": 179.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "my uncle has high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.88,
      "end_seconds": 187.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.83,
      "end_seconds": 197.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "okay this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 220.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "Okay: height 157 centimetres, heart rate 74, respiratory rate 16, weight 88 kilos, BMI works out to 35.7, pressure 117 over 70, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.1,
      "end_seconds": 225.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.5,
      "end_seconds": 229.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.82,
      "end_seconds": 250.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "The memory test score is a little low today and the rest of the neurological check is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.26,
      "end_seconds": 256.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.72,
      "end_seconds": 311.84,
      "duration_seconds": 38.12,
      "text": "Let's get a memory test, for memory loss. Let's book blood tests to look into memory loss. Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. I think the older adults' assessment service should see you too. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. A brain scan is something we might do if this doesn't improve next month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.57,
      "end_seconds": 327.86,
      "duration_seconds": 15.29,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you become suddenly confused, call us the same day or go to emergency. Book a review after the results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.49,
      "end_seconds": 332.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor"
    }
  ]
}